Description: Vendetta Council OS default toolset
 Metapackage pulling the command-line and desktop tools shipped by default
 on Vendetta Council OS on top of Debian and KDE Plasma.
 .
 Removing this package leaves a plain Debian + KDE system; the tools it
 pulled in can then be removed with `apt autoremove`.
